 * 2026 Official Figures — verify annually:
 *   IEP: 7-month window, 3 months before 65 birth month through 3 months after
 *   GEP: January 1 – March 31, coverage now starts 1st of month following enrollment
 *   SEP: 8 months from end of active employer coverage
