    text: 'Choose which enrollment period applies to you: IEP Early (the three months before your birth month), IEP Birth Month, IEP Late (months five, six, or seven of your IEP), General Enrollment Period (GEP — January through March if you missed your IEP), or Special Enrollment Period (SEP — within eight months of losing active employer coverage). If you are not sure which applies, use IEP Birth Month as your starting point.',
  },
